    'Most people who have heard the phrase "dairy science" know it only through an Amul hoarding or a school trip to a milk collection centre — few realise it is a real B.Tech/B.Sc degree with its own flagship deemed university, NDRI Karnal, not a vague sub-topic inside agriculture.',
