    'Dairy science graduates actually enter through two structurally different employment tracks that behave almost like two separate careers: the cooperative track (village milk society → district milk union → state federation, such as GCMMF/Amul, KMF/Nandini, Verka, Aavin, or Saras) and the private/corporate track (Hatsun Agro, Nestlé India, Britannia’s dairy business, Parag Milk Foods, Heritage Foods, Dodla Dairy, and Lactalis-owned Indian brands).',
