    'The cooperative track runs on quasi-government recruitment boards, fixed pay scales, and slow but genuinely secure progression, similar in structure to a PSU. The private track runs on FMCG-style hiring, KPI-linked appraisals, and faster but less certain pay growth. Picking a college without understanding which track you are aiming for is the single most common planning mistake in this field.',
  ],
};

