  'That organised-sector share is growing steadily as cold-chain infrastructure, branded packaged milk, and value-added products (paneer, cheese, yogurt, whey, flavoured milk) expand — and that expansion, not the total milk-production figure, is what is actually driving new dairy-technologist hiring.',
];

